        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have fewer than your maximum number of versatile vials, and you're either holding or wearing an alchemist's toolkit.</p><hr /><p>You scrounge together enough ingredients from what's left in your alchemist's toolkit to produce a few more versatile vials on the fly. Attempt a @Check[crafting|dc:@self.level] check. The DC is usually a standard-difficulty DC for your level, but the GM can assign a different DC based on the circumstances. The number of vials you regain depends on the result of your check (up to your maximum).</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You regain 3 versatile vials.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You regain 2 versatile vials.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You regain 1 versatile vial.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You don't regain any versatile vials.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
